  "content": "<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#000;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">\n<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Drop_Recipes/BH_MDRO_Header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"257\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">现在你可以在主世界合成敌对生物的掉落物了！</span></p>\n<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#000;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">\n<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">基本上，这个模组允许你合成所有只能通过击杀敌对生物获得的物品。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这对于那些移除特定敌人的主题整合包来说非常理想，或者只是为了更方便地获取游戏中急需的这些资源。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">有两种方式可以合成这些物品：第一种是使用常见的MC材料，第二种是使用一个新元素——主世界精华。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要服务器和朋友一起玩吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Drop_Recipes/BH_MDRO_PromoCard.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"289\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在寻找服务器来和朋友一起玩任何模组或整合包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>就是你的解决方案！他们提供性价比最高的Minecraft服务器，点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>并使用优惠码\"Lupin\"即可享受25%折扣。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Drop_Recipes/BH_MDRO_Summary.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"129\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">这个模组的目标是满足许多玩家的愿望——让你能够使用大量不同的建筑方块以及新变种来制作台阶。例如，玩家将有机会获得新的木质台阶，甚至是矿物方块制成的台阶。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Drop_Recipes/BH_MDRO_FAQ.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"129\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支持服务器吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！完全兼容！记住，与朋友一起玩模组的最佳方式就是使用BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接可享25%折扣</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个模组可以用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！但仅限于在Modrinth或CurseForge平台发布。上传到任何其他平台将侵犯我们的权利，是绝对不允许的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果你考虑将它添加到你的Modrinth或CurseForge整合包中，我们将非常感激。如果需要任何小改动或有任何疑问，请联系我们！</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以在我的频道录制这个模组的视频吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以，你可以在你的频道自由游玩这个模组或我们的任何整合包并制作相关视频，事实上，我们会非常感激！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mob_Drop_Recipes/BH_MDRO_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"129\"></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#000;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">\n<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/798/302/mob-drops-recipes-overworld-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"867\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
